## Notes

- Universal core fields are intentionally excluded — this registry is for *emergent*
  domain schema, which is where drift happens.
- A field appearing on only one or two things is not necessarily wrong; it may be
  genuinely emergent. Overlap (two field names, one meaning) is the signal worth acting on.
